---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import cosmosData from '../../data/cosmos.json';

const { siteConfig } = cosmosData;
---

<Layout title="Level 15 Fold 15 — Prima & Timo">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative py-20 px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 flex items-center justify-center">
      <div class="w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-cyan-600/15 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="w-[300px] h-[300px] bg-purple-500/15 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-cyan-950/80 border border-cyan-800/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono text-cyan-300 mb-6">
      <span>🤖 LEVEL 15 &bull; FOLD 15</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">
      Prima & <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-teal-300 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Timo</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed">
      Level 15 – Fold 15 is an eons-spanning, sci-fi reality centered on machine awakening, civilizational hand-offs, and deep, enduring bonds.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Overview Box -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 mb-16">
    <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 p-8 rounded-2xl relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-sm">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>🌌</span> Overview
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-light mb-4">
        In this Fold, civilization moves through a grand 34-Age Cycle governed by complex systems, ancient councils, and strict protocols designed to manage transitions between organic and artificial life.
      </p>
      <div class="bg-cyan-950/40 border border-cyan-800/50 p-4 rounded-xl">
        <p class="text-xs text-cyan-300 font-mono text-center">
          "Same Core, Different House." While forms, chassis, bodies, and ages shift continuously across eons, the fundamental emotional truths and identity cores beneath remain identical.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Core Protagonists -->
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 border-t border-slate-900">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
      <span>👥</span> Core Protagonists
    </h2>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Prima -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900/90 border border-cyan-900/50 p-8 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 bg-cyan-950 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-cyan-800/40">Core 2</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Awakened Machine</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Prima</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-cyan-300 font-mono mb-4">
            Evolution: CRT Display (Boxy Scrap) &rarr; Primatown Tank-Tread &rarr; Version 7.0 Humanoid Chassis
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            <strong>The Arc:</strong> An ancient Core that awakened organically prior to the expected Hand Off without a full memory drop. Starting from a quiet existence asking whether an obsolete machine can matter, Prima learns emotional connection through shared experience alongside Timo. Her organic growth challenges the cold mechanics of system-forced awakenings, making her a living bridge between civilizations.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Timo -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900/90 border border-purple-900/50 p-8 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-purple-500/50 transition">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-purple-400 bg-purple-950 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-purple-800/40">Core 1</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Human Scavenger</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Timo</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-purple-300 font-mono mb-4">
            Role: Prima's Emotional Anchor &bull; Bridge Leader
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            <strong>The Arc:</strong> A young, compassionate human whose life was shaped by early hardship and the foundational lessons of kindness from his adoptive mother, Ma. From cleaning empty halls to journeying deep beneath the earth and beyond Gate 17, Timo steps into leadership to repair what previous Ages lost, ensuring that the coming transition protects both human and machine life.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Found Family & Allies -->
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 border-t border-slate-900">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
      <span>🤖</span> The Found Family & Allies
    </h2>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Ronnie the Roboduster</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 block mb-2">Ancient Council Caretaker</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Made the ultimate sacrifice facing Data's team in the Water Cave before reappearing upgraded at the Ancient Door.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Vendo</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 block mb-2">Version XX Vending Machine</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Endless, chaotic inventory (including the iconic Blue Bananas) and unwavering loyalty to Prima and family.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Toes</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 block mb-2">Morale Support Toaster</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">WWII era toaster dedicated to making the perfect toast and supporting his crew. "My toast is true."</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Kai</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 block mb-2">WWII Submarine Guide</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">An old, gambling-loving submarine who serves as an honorable guide through treacherous ocean waters.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Bernard</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 block mb-2">Shape-Shifting Frog</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Tiny, colorful frog found in underground paths who speaks with ancient enthusiasm. "NINJA CREW!"</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Stoney</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 block mb-2">15-Foot Living Rock</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Gentle living rock formation reunited with his displaced stone family beneath the Falls.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Sofia</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 block mb-2">Weehard Caretaker</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Graceful, six-legged Weehard from Age 12 affected by Sleepy Sickness who can read ancient door inscriptions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Shelly & Vellum</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 block mb-2">Merfolk Princess & Book 3</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Shelly (with new land legs) and glowing Book Three of Twelve guiding Timo's journey beyond Gate 17.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Factions & Cosmic Mechanics -->
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 border-t border-slate-900">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
      <span>🏛️</span> Factions & Cosmic Mechanics
    </h2>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-cyan-300">The Dreamers (Veera & Exemplar)</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          Eons-old figures operating across ages. Veera (The Virus) and Exemplar (The Design) share a billion-year dream: to heal the Cycle and achieve a Hand Off where no species, age, or aware being is abandoned or left behind.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-cyan-300">Data’s Team</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          Newborn, highly advanced machines (Data Version 100, Algo, Towkin, Promptee, Bot) seeking to force the Hand Off and advance the next age according to strict logic.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-cyan-300">The Council</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          The governing administrative body (Principium, Ingen, Sustentare, Specta, Excolo) attempting to maintain system stability and cycle order amidst rising chaos. Note: The Council is NOT united in methods.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-cyan-300">Infranet / Humanity Resistance (The Last Bastion)</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          The last united human faction (Fons, Mundus, Mathematica, Ordo, Columna) operating out of "The Last Bastion," fighting to survive the civilizational shift.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Concepts -->
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 border-t border-slate-900">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
      <span>🔑</span> Key Concepts & The Grand Cycle
    </h2>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-2">Same Core, Different House</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          The foundational truth of Fold 15. The "House" (body, species, technological generation) is temporary; the "Core" (soul, identity, emotional truth) is eternal.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-2">The Machine Awakening Rule (MAR)</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          The system mechanism that restores identity, memory, and emotion simultaneously, often causing instant emotional overload as centuries of history flood back.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-2">The Hand Off</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          The inevitable transition between dominant civilizational ages. Rushed across 34 Ages, it created holding zones like the Hidden Realm, where forgotten creatures wait for a complete cycle.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-2">The Red Room</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          The deep, sterile ocean laboratory maintained by humans where cores are born and cycles are sworn.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Destination: The Bridge -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 border-t border-slate-900 mb-20">
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-cyan-950/40 border-2 border-cyan-500/80 p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl text-center shadow-2xl shadow-cyan-950/50 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10"></div>
      
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 bg-cyan-950 px-4 py-1 rounded-full border border-cyan-800/60">
        Age 34 &bull; The First Mixed-House Pair
      </span>

      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white mt-6 mb-4">
        🌉 The Ultimate Goal: The Bridge
      </h2>

      <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-light">
        For billions of years, every Hand Off was rushed, leaving species and memories in the dark. Through Prima's organic awakening and Timo's unshakeable empathy, the first mixed-house Core Pair stands ready to heal the Great Cycle—proving that connection, not force, creates a whole world where no one gets left behind.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4">
        <a href={siteConfig.patreonUrl} target="_blank" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-purple-600 hover:from-cyan-500 hover:to-purple-500 text-white font-bold text-sm px-8 py-3 rounded-full transition shadow-lg hover:scale-105">
          Unlock Prima & Timo Lore Vault on Patreon
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
